00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:11,400
Come on, Yuwen.

1135
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:12,440
Yuwen,

1136
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:13,200
what do you...

1137
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:13,960
What do you think?

1138
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:15,960
