1276
00:43:29,880 --> 00:43:30,640
(Silky, sweet, with a touch of bitter)
Artichoke.

1277
00:43:30,640 --> 00:43:31,440
(Cooking mellows bitter, lifts sweet)
Artichoke, right.

1278
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:33,440
I'll make you Candied Artichokes.

1279
00:43:33,440 --> 00:43:34,400
(To get the authentic flavor)

1280
00:43:34,680 --> 00:43:36,080
Okay, there's no...

1281
00:43:36,680 --> 00:43:38,080
Candied Artichokes?

1282
00:43:39,360 --> 00:43:42,400
From these two,
I can peel out two tiny pieces.

1283
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:44,480
This thing is more peel than flesh.

1284
00:43:44,760 --> 00:43:46,784
- After peeling, it's two tiny pieces.
- Right, just two tiny pieces.

1285
00:43:48,640 --> 00:43:49,720
Alright, you choose for us.

1286
00:43:50,520 --> 00:43:52,560
The one in Nai's hand
is very distinctive.

1287
00:43:52,560 --> 00:43:53,360
It's called chicory.

1288
00:43:53,840 --> 00:43:54,480
Chicory?

1289
00:43:54,480 --> 00:43:55,424
(Crisp and tender with a crunch,
slightly bitter-sweet, edible raw)

1290
00:43:55,880 --> 00:43:57,560
Then let them use the chicory.

1291
00:43:58,240 --> 00:43:59,560
A highly representative chicory.

1292
00:43:59,560 --> 00:44:00,440
(Another pun)
Chicory.

1293
00:44:00,840 --> 00:44:02,080
Okay, no problem. That's it.

1294
00:44:02,360 --> 00:44:03,280
Okay, fine.

1295
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:04,120
What is this thing? I'll try it.

1296
00:44:04,120 --> 00:44:05,120
Let's try it first

1297
00:44:05,120 --> 00:44:06,040
and see if it's good.

1298
00:44:06,040 --> 00:44:07,080
Can it be eaten raw?

1299
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:07,360
Yes.

1300
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:11,560
How is it?

1301
00:44:14,680 --> 00:44:15,560
What do you think?

1302
00:44:22,080 --> 00:44:23,600
Not that dramatic, but not tasty.

1303
00:44:23,600 --> 00:44:24,448
(Accidentally told the truth)

1304
00:44:24,840 --> 00:44:25,640
Its....

1305
00:44:25,640 --> 00:44:26,680
Its stalk part.

1306
00:44:26,680 --> 00:44:27,960
The closer to the stalk,
the more bitter.

1307
00:44:29,040 --> 00:44:29,840
So bitter.

1308
00:44:30,280 --> 00:44:32,080
It's like bitter medicine in your mouth

1309
00:44:32,080 --> 00:44:33,720
and no water in sight.

1310
00:44:34,720 --> 00:44:36,000
No water in sight.

1311
00:44:38,784 --> 00:44:40,896
(Alright, now it's bad)

1312
00:44:41,280 --> 00:44:41,960
So everyone,

1313
00:44:41,960 --> 00:44:43,880
