I'm looking for my good friend.

3050
01:45:28,120 --> 01:45:28,680
Yuanbao.

3051
01:45:29,397 --> 01:45:32,128
(Oyster business officially on track)

3052
01:45:40,302 --> 01:45:42,132
(Dressed up)

3053
01:45:43,519 --> 01:45:45,540
(New outfit)

3054
01:45:47,975 --> 01:45:49,056
(Alert)

3055
01:45:57,000 --> 01:45:57,960
Turn off the lights.

3056
01:45:58,680 --> 01:45:59,600
(Still feeling a bit shy)
Turn off the lights.

3057
01:46:07,661 --> 01:46:09,427
(Dare not move)

3058
01:46:15,400 --> 01:46:16,080
What are you doing? Stealing?

3059
01:46:16,080 --> 01:46:17,360
Mind your own business.

3060
01:46:17,360 --> 01:46:17,920
Are you stealing something?

3061
01:46:17,920 --> 01:46:18,640
Alright.

3062
01:46:18,640 --> 01:46:19,680
What are you doing?

3063
01:46:20,000 --> 01:46:21,080
I'm hungry.

3064
01:46:21,080 --> 01:46:22,200
I'm starving.

3065
01:46:22,480 --> 01:46:23,400
You're stealing something.

3066
01:46:23,400 --> 01:46:24,680
I didn't eat enough today.

3067
01:46:24,680 --> 01:46:25,360
I don't care.

3068
01:46:25,800 --> 01:46:26,600
I'm not full.

3069
01:46:27,200 --> 01:46:27,920
It's okay to not be full.

3070
01:46:27,920 --> 01:46:28,600
I'm not full.

3071
01:46:28,920 --> 01:46:29,280
No.

3072
01:46:29,600 --> 01:46:31,080
Can you just let me eat two?

3073
01:46:31,480 --> 01:46:32,720
Put the knife down first.

3074
01:46:32,720 --> 01:46:33,480
We can negotiate.

3075
01:46:33,480 --> 01:46:33,640
No.

3076
01:46:34,000 --> 01:46:34,360
No.

3077
01:46:35,560 --> 01:46:36,960
My oysters.

3078
01:46:38,840 --> 01:46:40,480
My oysters.

3079
01:46:40,480 --> 01:46:41,200
Okay.

3080
01:46:41,200 --> 01:46:42,360
My oysters!

3081
01:46:42,360 --> 01:46:43,280
Hide them.

3082
01:46:43,280 --> 01:46:43,800
No.

3083
01:46:44,560 --> 01:46:45,520
You can eat them.

3084
01:46:49,640 --> 01:46:50,640
What is this?

3085
01:46:51,200 --> 01:46:51,680
Wait.

3086
01:46:51,680 --> 01:46:52,480
Let's go.

3087
01:46:58,960 --> 01:47:00,080
The oysters won't go bad.

3088
01:47:00,080 --> 01:47:00,880
Look how nice I am.

3089
01:47:03,280 --> 01:47:03,840
Just stay hungry.

3090
01:47:03,840 --> 01:47:04,120
Stay hungry.

3091
01:47:04,120 --> 01:47:05,160
Young people aren't afraid of hunger.

3092
01:47:12,280 --> 01:47:13,680
(The oyster after the disaster)
Get one as I can.

3093
01:47:17,120 --> 01:47:17,640
Where's my knife?

3094
01:47:18,040 --> 01:47:19,760
Xingxu was crying in the back just now.

3095
01:47:19,760 --> 01:47:20,880
Who? Xingxu?

3096
01:47:21,800 --> 01:47:22,600
Why?

3097
01:47:22,600 --> 01:47:23,120
I don't know.

3098
01:47:23,120 --> 01:47:24,480
He said he felt terrible.

3099
01:47:25,120 --> 01:47:26,040
He felt terrible?

3100
01:47:26,040 --> 01:47:26,400
Yeah.

3101
01:47:27,120 --> 01:47:28,240
He ate too many oysters, right?

3102
01:47:28,640 --> 01:47:29,440
Behind the van.

3103
01:47:29,440 --> 01:47:30,280
He said he was having a hard time.

3104
01:47:30,280 --> 01:47:31,120
He's been crying there.

3105
01:47:31,120 --> 01:47:32,040
Take a look, you guys.

3106
01:47:36,240 --> 01:47:37,320
Wait a moment.

3107
01:47:40,105 --> 01:47:41,360
(Hiding the last oyster)

3108
01:47:41,360 --> 01:47:42,720
What are you doing here?

3109
01:47:47,800 --> 01:47:48,920
What are you doing here?

3110
01:47:50,960 --> 01:47:51,760
What is that?

3111
01:47:52,600 --> 01:47:53,160
A rock.

3112
01:47:54,240 --> 01:47:55,080
What are you doing here?

3113
01:47:55,080 --> 01:47:55,640
So scary.

3114
01:47:56,160 --> 01:47:57,000
What are you doing?

3115
01:47:57,315 --> 01:47:57,680
(A sudden return)

3116
01:47:57,680 --> 01:47:58,640
That's so scary.

3117
01:47:58,640 --> 01:47:59,960
I just want to eat an oyster.

3118
01:47:59,960 --> 01:48:01,240
You took my tools...

3119
01:48:01,560 --> 01:48:02,200
Well...

3120
01:48:02,200 --> 01:48:02,920
Tools?

3121
01:48:02,920 --> 01:48:03,520
Took your oysters?

3122
01:48:03,520 --> 01:48:05,080
All my cooking tools were taken away.

3123
01:48:05,520 --> 01:48:06,120
He's...

3124
01:48:06,120 --> 01:48:06,880
He's in a tough spot.

3125
01:48:06,880 --> 01:48:07,720
He has to first...

3126
01:48:07,720 --> 01:48:08,800
No.

3127
01:48:10,040 --> 01:48:11,280
This is your tool?

3128
01:48:11,280 --> 01:48:12,280
(Have mercy)
My last one.

3129
01:48:12,280 --> 01:48:13,200
Oyster.

3130
01:48:13,200 --> 01:48:14,720
Why are you dressed like this?

3131
01:48:15,280 --> 01:48:16,320
This is his outfit.

3132
01:48:16,680 --> 01:48:18,560
Eating oysters is noble.

3133
01:48:18,560 --> 01:48:19,160
You...

3134
01:48:19,160 --> 01:48:19,760
It's French cuisine.

3135
01:48:19,760 --> 01:48:20,880
Is your attire so dignified and formal?

3136
01:48:20,880 --> 01:48:23,240
I must dress formally
for French cuisine.

3137
01:48:23,240 --> 01:48:24,240
You only have one oyster left.

3138
01:48:25,480 --> 01:48:26,400
Give it to him.

3139
01:48:26,400 --> 01:48:27,480
Can one satisfy you?

3140
01:48:27,480 --> 01:48:28,400
Just eat one.

3141
01:48:28,400 --> 01:48:29,520
One is better than none.

3142
01:48:29,960 --> 01:48:30,280
Wait.

3143
01:48:31,120 --> 01:48:31,480
No!

3144
01:48:32,760 --> 01:48:33,560
It's mine!

3145
01:48:38,263 --> 01:48:39,985
(This is so hard)

3146
01:48:40,320 --> 01:48:40,840
Xingxu.

3147
01:48:41,560 --> 01:48:41,840
Where

3148
01:48:41,840 --> 01:48:42,560
are you going?

3149
01:48:42,560 --> 01:48:43,400
To find oysters?

3150
01:48:43,400 --> 01:48:44,080
Leave me alone.

3151
01:48:44,080 --> 01:48:44,400
I'm...

3152
01:48:45,120 --> 01:48:46,240
I'm going to grow oysters.

3153
01:48:47,160 --> 01:48:48,880
I told you to come over and catch him.

3154
01:48:49,880 --> 01:48:51,120
Then what are these clothes for?

3155
01:48:53,080 --> 01:48:54,480
These are all disguises.

3156
01:48:55,600 --> 01:48:57,080
He's so thick-skinned.

3157
01:48:57,080 --> 01:48:58,720
He wore the formal wear underneath...

3158
01:48:58,720 --> 01:48:58,960
Yeah.

3159
01:48:58,960 --> 01:48:59,720
And had a lot of disguises.

3160
01:48:59,720 --> 01:49:00,880
Then he came over to grill oysters.

3161
01:49:01,880 --> 01:49:02,480
You know what?

3162
01:49:02,480 --> 01:49:04,240
This little red outfit suits me.

3163
01:49:05,880 --> 01:49:07,280
How do I look?

3164
01:49:07,280 --> 01:49:08,910
(Makeup imitation progress: 100%)

3165
01:49:09,309 --> 01:49:11,150
(Lin Yi's workstation)

3166
01:49:11,150 --> 01:49:12,760
(Witnessed the entire chaos)

3167
01:49:13,471 --> 01:49:15,456
(Taking the fuse beeds props
in the chaos)

3168
01:49:19,983 --> 01:49:21,208
(Lin Yi's workstation)

3169
01:49:28,966 --> 01:49:31,008
(Lin Yi's editing workstation,
Sun Honglei's fuse beads workstation)

3170
01:49:32,718 --> 01:49:34,496
(Continue working)

3171
01:49:40,640 --> 01:49:43,488
(Confused)

3172
01:49:47,080 --> 01:49:48,080
How wonderful.

3173
01:49:48,760 --> 01:49:49,320
These two brothers

3174
01:49:50,560 --> 01:49:51,480
are so full of love.

3175
01:49:52,360 --> 01:49:53,440
Is it that hard?

3176
01:49:55,080 --> 01:49:56,200
This is too hard.

3177
01:49:58,960 --> 01:49:59,520
Okay.

3178
01:50:00,451 --> 01:50:02,304
(Li Naiwen and Lin Yi
completed the mission)

3179
01:50:03,086 --> 01:50:05,391
Blue, green, black.

3180
01:50:06,081 --> 01:50:09,632
Blue, green, black. Blue, green, black.

3181
01:50:10,528 --> 01:50:12,256
(The only three colors)

3182
01:50:17,480 --> 01:50:18,800
Okay.

3183
01:50:18,800 --> 01:50:20,720
Let's complete the mission together.

3184
01:50:20,720 --> 01:50:22,240
Otherwise, I'll lock onto you.

3185
01:50:22,284 --> 01:50:23,840
(Saying harsh words first)

3186
01:50:23,840 --> 01:50:25,280
I finished my mission long ago.

3187
01:50:26,960 --> 01:50:28,200
I caught Sun Honglei.

3188
01:50:30,842 --> 01:50:31,560
(Painfully lost the pattern sample)

3189
01:50:31,560 --> 01:50:33,000
I'm so pissed off.

3190
01:50:34,240 --> 01:50:35,200
I'm so pissed off.

3191
01:50:39,080 --> 01:50:39,920
I'm here.

3192
01:50:39,920 --> 01:50:40,920
What are you doing here?

3193
01:50:40,920 --> 01:50:41,640
I'm just playing.

3194
01:50:45,000 --> 01:50:46,360
(Ransacked)
You're making a fuse bead pattern?

3195
01:50:46,360 --> 01:50:46,960
Yes.

3196
01:50:46,960 --> 01:50:48,080
Your beads...

3197
01:50:48,680 --> 01:50:49,440
You're making a fuse bead pattern?

3198
01:50:49,840 --> 01:50:50,120
Yeah.

3199
01:50:50,120 --> 01:50:50,880
Let me help you.

3200
01:50:51,320 --> 01:50:51,760
Yeah.

3201
01:50:52,520 --> 01:50:53,520
This is too hard.

3202
01:50:53,520 --> 01:50:55,160
Let's finish it together with you, okay?

3203
01:50:55,440 --> 01:50:56,560
Really hard.

3204
01:50:56,560 --> 01:50:57,440
Don't hide anymore.

3205
01:50:57,440 --> 01:50:58,400
Put it on the table.

3206
01:50:58,400 --> 01:50:59,400
It might hurt your eyes.

3207
01:50:59,909 --> 01:51:01,382
(Heartbraking)

3208
01:51:01,600 --> 01:51:03,320
Yeah, my eyes are worn out.

3209
01:51:03,320 --> 01:51:04,880
I haven't even started yet.

3210
01:51:04,880 --> 01:51:05,920
He already found me.

3211
01:51:06,320 --> 01:51:07,160
(It's too hard for me)
I know how to do this.

3212
01:51:07,160 --> 01:51:07,840
I'll help you...

3213
01:51:07,840 --> 01:51:08,240
Do you know how?

3214
01:51:08,240 --> 01:51:08,800
I do.

3215
01:51:09,000 --> 01:51:10,080
(Young people's domain)
So what should we do?

3216
01:51:10,080 --> 01:51:11,600
This target is too big.

3217
01:51:11,600 --> 01:51:12,640
What pattern are you trying to make?

3218
01:51:12,640 --> 01:51:13,240
Make

3219
01:51:13,240 --> 01:51:14,680
our show's logo?

3220
01:51:15,280 --> 01:51:16,320
It isn't fast this way.

3221
01:51:16,320 --> 01:51:17,440
This is fast.

3222
01:51:17,440 --> 01:51:18,560
Look, shake it,

3223
01:51:20,320 --> 01:51:21,040
then like this.

3224
01:51:22,120 --> 01:51:23,320
This way is fast.

3225
01:51:26,800 --> 01:51:27,440
We need a pattern sample.

3226
01:51:27,440 --> 01:51:28,320
Then I'll go get the pattern sample.

3227
01:51:28,320 --> 01:51:29,320
Fei has it.

3228
01:51:30,120 --> 01:51:31,160
I'll go find him.

3229
01:51:32,080 --> 01:51:33,000
Time for revenge.

3230
01:51:33,880 --> 01:51:35,360
Yuwen, this isn't about
the game anymore.

3231
01:51:35,360 --> 01:51:36,320
It's between us now.

3232
01:51:36,320 --> 01:51:37,680
Got it. Go ahead.

3233
01:51:39,680 --> 01:51:40,440
It's this pattern.

3234
01:51:42,160 --> 01:51:42,960
What is he doing?

3235
01:51:42,960 --> 01:51:44,680
He wants to make a pattern like this.

3236
01:51:45,200 --> 01:51:45,680
And then?

3237
01:51:49,040 --> 01:51:49,920
The props are gone.

3238
01:51:50,680 --> 01:51:51,600
The pattern sample was snatched.

3239
01:51:51,600 --> 01:51:52,920
(No other choice)
I have to do it without a sample.

3240
01:51:52,920 --> 01:51:53,920
You'll help him make it?

3241
01:51:53,920 --> 01:51:54,720
I'm helping him make it.

3242
01:51:55,520 --> 01:51:56,560
What is this?

3243
01:51:56,560 --> 01:51:57,040
Fuse beads.

3244
01:52:00,520 --> 01:52:02,480
The avenger is here.

3245
01:52:02,840 --> 01:52:06,040
There's definitely something wrong
with Guo Jingfei's makeup.

3246
01:52:07,849 --> 01:52:09,852
(Homemade spray bottle)

3247
01:52:13,000 --> 01:52:14,480
Have you seen Guo Jingfei?

3248
01:52:14,765 --> 01:52:16,864
(Unaware of the coming danger)

3249
01:52:19,000 --> 01:52:19,680
I finished.

3250
01:52:20,120 --> 01:52:21,640
Then why are you still doing this?

3251
01:52:21,640 --> 01:52:22,160
I'm just...

3252
01:52:22,160 --> 01:52:23,160
I'm just

3253
01:52:23,160 --> 01:52:25,080
reinforcing it.

3254
01:52:25,080 --> 01:52:26,440
(Striving for perfection)

3255
01:52:26,440 --> 01:52:27,040
You've really finished?

3256
01:52:27,040 --> 01:52:28,160
I finished a long time ago.

3257
01:52:28,160 --> 01:52:29,160
I'll help you, really.

3258
01:52:29,160 --> 01:52:29,760
Tell me,

3259
01:52:29,760 --> 01:52:30,960
what is your mission?

3260
01:52:32,680 --> 01:52:33,760
We finished too.

3261
01:52:33,760 --> 01:52:34,160
Really?

3262
01:52:36,680 --> 01:52:37,920
I ruined myself like this.

3263
01:52:37,920 --> 01:52:38,760
But I might not win.

3264
01:52:38,760 --> 01:52:39,240
You know?

3265
01:52:40,360 --> 01:52:42,560
This

3266
01:52:42,560 --> 01:52:44,000
is originated from life,

3267
01:52:44,000 --> 01:52:44,480
but

3268
01:52:45,120 --> 01:52:45,960
what's that saying?

3269
01:52:45,960 --> 01:52:46,560
It's above life.

3270
01:52:46,560 --> 01:52:48,480
You've completely destroyed life.

3271
01:52:48,480 --> 01:52:49,080
No.

3272
01:52:53,840 --> 01:52:54,160
Just like this.

3273
01:52:54,160 --> 01:52:55,851
(Satisfied)

3274
01:52:58,049 --> 01:52:59,400
(Admiring the final cut)

3275
01:52:59,400 --> 01:53:00,040
Good.

3276
01:53:00,040 --> 01:53:00,800
Is it okay?

3277
01:53:00,800 --> 01:53:01,280
Send it to them.

3278
01:53:02,240 --> 01:53:02,960
This is like

3279
01:53:03,800 --> 01:53:04,720
my Visa on Arrival video.

3280
01:53:06,745 --> 01:53:09,248
(Joining the fun)

3281
01:53:10,680 --> 01:53:11,320
Are you done?

3282
01:53:11,520 --> 01:53:12,720
I finished long ago.

3283
01:53:13,000 --> 01:53:13,960
Do you want to grill oysters?

3284
01:53:15,812 --> 01:53:16,640
Right.

3285
01:53:16,640 --> 01:53:18,480
Why not just torch it
with the flame gun?

3286
01:53:20,410 --> 01:53:21,760
Really?

3287
01:53:21,760 --> 01:53:23,640
Hold the oyster with tongs
and spray from underneath.

3288
01:53:23,640 --> 01:53:24,760
It'll be cooked.

3289
01:53:25,320 --> 01:53:26,040
Like this?

3290
01:53:26,560 --> 01:53:27,520
Spray upwards

3291
01:53:27,880 --> 01:53:28,360
from down there.

3292
01:53:28,840 --> 01:53:29,760
Isn't it done then?

3293
01:53:29,760 --> 01:53:30,280
It's done, right?

3294
01:53:30,280 --> 01:53:31,120
This is unbeatable.

3295
01:53:32,680 --> 01:53:33,200
Almost done.

3296
01:53:33,200 --> 01:53:34,000
Okay, done.

3297
01:53:34,000 --> 01:53:34,280
Okay.

3298
01:53:35,000 --> 01:53:35,800
So is you eat it,

3299
01:53:35,800 --> 01:53:37,360
your mission is complete.

3300
01:53:37,360 --> 01:53:37,760
Right?

3301
01:53:39,000 --> 01:53:39,760
I'll eat one first.

3302
01:53:39,760 --> 01:53:40,680
I'll taste it first.

3303
01:53:41,200 --> 01:53:41,480
Okay.

3304
01:53:41,480 --> 01:53:42,680
It's hard, very hard.

3305
01:53:42,680 --> 01:53:45,563
(Mission progress: 1/5
It's so hard to take a bite)

3306
01:53:47,160 --> 01:53:48,120
A long sigh.

3307
01:53:49,320 --> 01:53:49,600
Done.

3308
01:53:49,600 --> 01:53:50,320
Did you finish your mission?

3309
01:53:51,280 --> 01:53:51,920
Yes.

3310
01:53:52,560 --> 01:53:53,040
Well...

3311
01:53:53,040 --> 01:53:53,680
All from memory.

3312
01:53:53,680 --> 01:53:54,360
Where's the tablet?

3313
01:53:54,360 --> 01:53:55,160
(Time to settle the score between us)

3314
01:53:55,160 --> 01:53:55,880
Did you hide it?

3315
01:53:59,000 --> 01:53:59,800
Remove his makeup.

3316
01:54:00,760 --> 01:54:01,520
No.

3317
01:54:01,520 --> 01:54:02,560
He definitely keeps this makeup

3318
01:54:02,560 --> 01:54:03,600
for a reason.

3319
01:54:04,160 --> 01:54:05,160
It hurts.

3320
01:54:05,160 --> 01:54:06,680
I feel like I got hit with a sap.

3321
01:54:06,680 --> 01:54:07,680
It hurts so much.

3322
01:54:07,680 --> 01:54:10,240
(Don't run)

3323
01:54:10,240 --> 01:54:11,760
His makeup is definitely suspicious.

3324
01:54:12,480 --> 01:54:13,040
He ran.

3325
01:54:13,760 --> 01:54:15,160
Let's see where you can run to.

3326
01:54:19,760 --> 01:54:20,240
Come on, continue.

3327
01:54:31,760 --> 01:54:32,640
(Exhausted)
So tired.

3328
01:54:33,120 --> 01:54:34,240
Mr. Sun, you can take my...

3329
01:54:34,960 --> 01:54:36,320
I'll give it to you later, for real.

3330
01:54:37,120 --> 01:54:38,000
Go.

3331
01:54:38,760 --> 01:54:39,360
I'll give you the tablet.

3332
01:54:39,360 --> 01:54:40,280
Smudge the makeup first.

3333
