Actually, your younger brother

3614
02:03:00,400 --> 02:03:01,560
and I used to...

3615
02:03:01,560 --> 02:03:02,200
You dated him.

3616
02:03:02,200 --> 02:03:03,280
All the family assets

3617
02:03:03,280 --> 02:03:05,160
will all come to me,

3618
02:03:05,160 --> 02:03:07,800
the Viscount's favorite youngest son's.

3619
02:03:07,800 --> 02:03:08,840
I am

3620
02:03:08,840 --> 02:03:10,040
Xingxu's

3621
02:03:10,040 --> 02:03:11,240
youngest grandfather.

3622
02:03:11,240 --> 02:03:11,880
You mean

3623
02:03:11,880 --> 02:03:13,200
you are my illegitimate son?

3624
02:03:13,200 --> 02:03:15,240
I'm the only real grandchild

3625
02:03:15,240 --> 02:03:15,960
here.

3626
02:03:16,240 --> 02:03:17,280
Pass the test

3627
02:03:17,280 --> 02:03:18,240
to inherit

3628
02:03:18,240 --> 02:03:18,960
Viscount Castle.

3629
02:03:20,360 --> 02:03:21,760
This is truly an old baby.

3630
02:03:22,000 --> 02:03:22,920
This is okay.

3631
02:03:22,920 --> 02:03:23,920
He's so cute.

3632
02:03:23,920 --> 02:03:26,240
We seem to be acting
in a children's play.

3633
02:03:27,280 --> 02:03:28,160
I can even walk like this.

3634
02:03:30,120 --> 02:03:31,440
This isn't the Song Qian I know.

3635
02:03:32,000 --> 02:03:33,040
Okay, let's get straight to the point.

3636
02:03:34,480 --> 02:03:35,760
Protect our big brother.

3637
02:03:35,760 --> 02:03:36,768
(Who will win in the end?)

3638
02:03:37,440 --> 02:03:38,520
Everyone, choose

3639
02:03:38,520 --> 02:03:40,400
the person you think you know best.

3640
02:03:40,400 --> 02:03:41,000
Naiwen, you first.

3641
02:03:41,000 --> 02:03:41,640
You go first.

3642
02:03:41,640 --> 02:03:43,080
Can you choose someone stronger?

3643
02:03:43,360 --> 02:03:44,400
You just want me to choose you, right?

3644
02:03:44,400 --> 02:03:45,320
I choose Wang Yuwen.

3645
02:03:45,520 --> 02:03:45,920
Nai.

3646
02:03:46,360 --> 02:03:47,240
I have a boyfriend.

3647
02:03:47,240 --> 02:03:48,240
Who is it?

3648
02:03:48,240 --> 02:03:48,880
What does he do?

3649
02:03:49,840 --> 02:03:51,080
You sure are nosy.

3650
02:03:51,080 --> 02:03:52,480
She might not be able to guess this.

3651
02:03:53,160 --> 02:03:53,640
Liu Yuning.

3652
02:03:53,640 --> 02:03:54,640
What are you doing?

3653
02:03:55,200 --> 02:03:55,920
Darling.

3654
02:03:56,720 --> 02:03:58,880
What a perfectly smooth line.

3655
02:03:58,880 --> 02:04:00,880
This tone is very suggestive.

3656
02:04:01,638 --> 02:04:03,264
(Who will get the right of inheritance?)
